            <ArticleTitle>[The styloid syndrome. Apropos 3 cases].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>659-66</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The paper deals with the cases of 3 women, aged between 28 and 35 years, the three having had tonsillectomy and complaining of troubles compatible with the styloid syndrome. X-ray and tomographs corroborate the diagnosis. Under general anesthesia the abnormally developed processes were high resected and the complaints gone.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
